{title: This Is The Day}
{key: D}

{comment: Chorus}
[D]This is the day, This is the day,
That the [A]Lord has made, That the Lord has made.
[A]We will rejoice, We will rejoice,
And be [D]glad in it, And be glad in it!
[G]This is the day that the [D]Lord has made,
[G]We will rejoice and be [D]glad in it!
[D]This is the day, This is the day,
That the [A]Lord has [D]made.
